<title>GERMANY: Germans seek 12,300T free-mkt wheat/80,000T barley.</title>
<headline>Germans seek 12,300T free-mkt wheat/80,000T barley.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>German grain traders bid for 12,300 tonnes of wheat on the free market at refunds of 10.39 to 14.90 Ecus per tonne at Thursday's EU export tender, traders said.</p>
<p>Bids were made for 80,000 tonnes of free-market barley at 26.69 to 28.80 Ecus, they said.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
